Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:44:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Deaths: a falling body is never thrown (no part faster
 than maxSpeed or rising faster than maxUp 250 cm/s, a blast 1.5 x blastUp;
 staged bodies flew over the awning and up a shop front); a body still falling
 when its unit is retired is frozen at once instead of simulating hidden (test
 MurderInc.Death.Retired)

Not built or tested yet: the GPU box ended before this change was made.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HkcHdD7NbyxwnFfuuSpZY4
